# suite TITEMVAL
ok 1 - the full 30 character code is read, not truncated
ok 2 - the item is known in the company
ok 3 - the sister code reads back as itself
ok 4 - two codes differing near their end are two items
ok 5 - an unknown item is reported, never invented
ok 6 - a released stocked item may hold physical stock
ok 7 - an incomplete draft is not ready for release
ok 8 - the review lists what is missing, by requirement
ok 9 - a draft missing information cannot be activated
ok 10 - the refusal carries a stable reason code
ok 11 - one supplier alias on two items is not resolved
ok 12 - the revision carries its own effectivity
ok 13 - an unsupported function is refused, not guessed
ok 14 - an empty search is refused, not a whole file scan
1..14
